OL,3,GNEWSADry weather creates 'brilliant'
OL,4,Aconditions for ospreys
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtended periods of dry weather over
OL,7,Fthe summer have created "absolutely
OL,8,Fbrilliant" feeding conditions for
OL,9,Fospreys at Rutland Water, the
OL,10,FLeicestershire and Rutland Wildlife
OL,11,FTrust has said.
OL,13,FThe Rutland Osprey Project began in
OL,14,F1996 and saw young osprey chicks
OL,15,Frelocated from Scotland to Rutland
OL,16,FWater, with the aim of creating a
OL,17,Fself-sustaining breeding colony.
OL,19,FSince then, 333 ospreys have been born
OL,20,Fas part of the project and in 2025 a
OL,21,Fnew record was set when 11 breeding
OL,22,Fpairs produced 31 chicks.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
