OL,3,GNEWSADry weather creates 'brilliant'
OL,4,Aconditions for ospreys
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Sexton, from the trust, said recent
OL,7,Fdry weather had "increased fishing
OL,8,Fopportunities" for adult birds and he
OL,9,Fhad "seen a lot of the chicks fledge a
OL,10,Flittle bit earlier" as a result.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
